  "limitations": [
    "P01 integrated native evidence: the C01, C02 and C03 drivers ran against the single P01-prepared fixture bundle with AIRS_NATIVE_SUBJECT=P01, writing native-<chunk>/ and native-acceptance-<chunk>.json under evidence/P01; tools/native-acceptance/merge_phase.py combined them (refusing on a different executable, bundle or host) into native-acceptance.json.",
    "C01 evaluator updates since C01's completion, made for P01: N06/N08 now expect Runtime Security available (its scan view) and the nine other destinations unavailable; N07 scopes the checked-radio assertion to the Appearance group (Settings has held C02's 'AIRS region' radio since C02); N03's focus-ring metric counts any warm accent pixel (r>120, r-b>70, r-g>40) because the ring renders in Paper's rust accent (146,56,19), which the earlier r>180 threshold missed although the ring is drawn (the first P01 run failed N03 at 55 pixels; that capture is superseded by the rerun, which counts 3972 vs 0). native-checks.json C01-N06/N08 wording updated accordingly.",
    "The xtask controller test that asserted C02/C03 inventories were absent now asserts P01 includes all three members' checks and that P02 (no inventories yet) still fails closed.",
